rbell deadlift** 3\\u00d75 (moderate) \\u00b7 [\\u25b6 video](https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=how+to+Barbell+deadlift+proper+form)\\n**DB rear-delt fly** 3\\u00d712 \\u00b7 [\\u25b6 video](https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=how+to+dumbbell+rear-delt+fly+proper+form)\\n**DB curl** 3\\u00d712 \\u00b7 [\\u25b6 video](https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=how+to+dumbbell+curl+proper+form)\", \"title\": \"Friday \\u00b7 Pull\"}, {\"color\": 4431943, \"description\": \"**Pedal exerciser** only on days you're under 10,000 steps at 5 PM; the 5 PM reminder says how long\\n**Warm up** 5 min easy pedal + 1 light set of the first lift\\n**Rest** 60\\u201390 s between sets\\n**Weight** pick one where the last 2 reps feel hard but your form stays clean; go up a little when every set feels easy\\n**Each of you** uses your own weights; do the sets together, taking turns\\nVideos are YouTube searches for a form tutorial, so pick one from a trusted trainer. Stop if anything hurts; this isn't medical advice.\", \"title\": \"Every day \\u00b7 steps, pedal + how-to\"}], \"username\": \"Workout Guides\"}",
